<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head>{% set title='글쓰기' %}{% include '_head.njk' %}</head><body class="interior-page write-page">{% include '_header.njk' %}<main class="container py-5" style="max-width:800px"><div class="page-label">CREATE</div><h1 class="section-title">한 글자씩 이어볼까요?</h1><p class="text-secondary mb-4">완벽하지 않아도 괜찮아요. 짧고 솔직하게 작성해 보세요.</p><form class="card shadow-sm write-card" method="post" action="/poems"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{ csrfToken }}"><div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5"><label for="word" class="form-label fw-bold">제시어</label><input id="word" data-poem-word class="form-control form-control-lg" name="word" value="{{ form.word }}" minlength="2" maxlength="6" required placeholder="2~6글자 단어">{% if errors.word %}<div class="text-danger small mt-1">{{ errors.word }}</div>{% endif %}<div data-poem-preview class="form-text mb-4">제시어를 입력하세요.</div>{% if errors.lines %}<div class="text-danger small mb-2">{{ errors.lines }}</div>{% endif %}<div data-poem-lines>{% for line in form.lines %}<div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label fw-semibold" for="line-{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ form.word[loop.index0] }}로 시작하는 문장</label><input class="form-control" id="line-{{ loop.index0 }}" name="lines[{{ loop.index0 }}]" value="{{ line }}" maxlength="80" required>{% if errors['line' + loop.index0] %}<div class="text-danger small">{{ errors['line' + loop.index0] }}</div>{% endif %}</div>{% endfor %}</div><div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2 mt-4"><a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="/">취소</a><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">등록하기</button></div></div></form></main>{% include '_footer.njk' %}</body></html>
